{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, approach, take, and process it. Otherwise, move to empty location and recharge. list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Condition ID = IsLocationOccupied    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanForEmptyLocations    /> <Action ID = RechargeBattery    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />",
